        "lib/Service/PurgeService.php:163 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteApp(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig  Removes all keys in appconfig belonging to the app."
      ],
      "lines": [
        "3 uses in 3 files of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 33 to 35. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Migration/Uninstall.php:64 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteApp(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig  Removes all keys in appconfig belonging to the app.",
        "  lib/Service/CalendarChoice.php:34 OCP\\Constants::PERMISSION_CREATE: deprecated since Nextcloud 13; Use \\OCP\\Constants::PERMISSION_CREATE instead",
        "  lib/Service/PurgeService.php:163 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteApp(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig  Removes all keys in appconfig belonging to the app."
      ]
    },
